<h3>About Open Textbook Collaborative: Career and Technical Education</h3>

<p>The Open Textbook Collaborative is a project to create a community college-led, statewide collaborative in New Jersey to fill an important need for open textbooks and other learning resources.</p>

<h3>For more information, visit our <a href="https://middlesexcc.libguides.com/OTCProject/home" target="_blank">Open Textbook Collaborative guide</a>.</h3>

